selling or licensing the software, advertising-supported services, paid
training using the software, and hosted, SaaS or API services for third parties.
A business use does not become personal use because access is free or the user
is a sole trader. A separate written license is required for these uses.

4. No redistribution or third-party access

You may not publish, distribute, sublicense, sell, rent, lend, share or otherwise
make Covered Material available to another person, in original or modified
form, as source, binaries, bundles, containers, packages, mirrors or derivative
